    {
      "id": "library/10665-205344/blocks/prose-page-020",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Page 20",
      "pageStart": 20,
      "pageEnd": 20,
      "target": "../sections/page-020.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "SEA/AIDS/81\nPage 17\n\nSetting up a resource centre where all materials (communication products) related to\nHIV/AIDS/STD are available would also be very helpful and cost-effective. These materials\ncan be used as they are, if appropriate, or adapted and used as prototypes for new materials.\n\nCost and cost-effectiveness of materials. Determining affordability and cost-\neffectiveness is important, as resources are always scarce. Cost-effectiveness of materials (in\nterms of development, production and dissemination costs as compared to their reach and\neffectiveness) is, therefore, an important cons",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Recommends a resource centre for HIV/AIDS materials and discusses cost-effectiveness, production and updating of materials. It then introduces planning for dissemination so that materials reach their intended audiences.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-11"
