      "target": "../sections/page-025.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "SEA/AIDS/81\nPage 22\n\nfirst draft was prepared by Mr Kiran Karnik. Further work on the draft was carried out by\nMs Carol Larivee and Dr Saroj Jha and it was finalized by Dr Jai P. Narain. Editorial\nassistance was provided by Dr Nina Mattock, WHO/SEARO, and Ms Nancy Jamieson,\nWHO/STC.",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Credits the people who drafted, revised, finalized and edited the document.",
