        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Page 29",
      "pageStart": 29,
      "pageEnd": 29,
      "target": "../sections/page-029.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "SEA/AIDS/81\nPage 26\n\n2.2 Services\n\nServices play an important role in supporting behavioural change and facilitating the\nadoption of appropriate safe/preventive practices and behaviour.\n\nFor this target group the services include:\n\n|\n\nCounselling, which is of special relevance for this age group;\n\nCondom distribution;\n\nSTD/health services; and\n\n|\n\nInformation service (‘hotline’ through telephones, or a ‘post box’) providing\nrelevant information on an anonymous basis.\n\n2.3 Training\n\nThe categories to which special attention needs to be devoted for training in youth-\nrelated activities include t",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Covers support services for youth, such as counselling, condoms, STD care and anonymous hotlines, along with priority groups for training and the role of targeted behavioural research. It begins listing core prevention messages for adolescents.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-11"
