      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Page 30",
      "pageStart": 30,
      "pageEnd": 30,
      "target": "../sections/page-030.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "SEA/AIDS/81\nPage 27\n~ Seeking appropriate treatment for STDs;\n\n— The STD and HIV relationship, i.e. recognition of how STD increases the risk of\nHIV;\n\n— Proper condom use;\n— Hazards of drug use, particularly injecting;\n— Existence of support/counselling services and where to go for these; and\n\n~— Knowledge about human sexuality (development, behaviour, relationships),\nespecially for adolescents.\n\nThe choice of medium for each message will depend upon the extent of access that the\ntarget group has to the medium. The situational analysis and IEC research should provide\ncrucial data on this. In g",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Completes the list of youth messages on STDs, condom use, drug hazards and sexuality, then lists media products suitable for young audiences. It discusses possible communicators such as peers and teachers and notes integration with school sex education.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
