      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Opens Annex 2 on planning a mass awareness campaign, defining it as coordinated use of all mass media to deliver a sequence of basic HIV/AIDS/STD messages. It warns that ad hoc media spots are not a campaign and describes early steps such as research and creating a unifying logo and signature line.",
